{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             ﻿\n \n \n \n \n \n ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。櫻坂46の関有美子です🐱\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 『BACKS LIVE !!』の会場に足を運んでくださった、もしくは配信でご覧くださった皆さん本当にありがとうございました☺︎\n 3日間、無事みんなで完走しました。\n \n \n \n #ゆみこかめら\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1VPEKYAEBK8Y6X1XCPXBA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 久しぶりに見れたファンの方の顔と伝わる熱気が本当に熱くて『ああ、私がもう一度見たいと思っていたのはこの景色だ！』と思いました。\n \n 最初に上がっていくときから心臓がバクバクで自分でも気持ちが昂っているのが分かって、このライブを心から楽しんで帰ってほしい。来てくださる、見てくださる皆さんの心に強く強く残り続ける日にしたい。\n この想いが届けと願った3日間。私の気持ちは届いてましたか？\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1VQP48B0BHP4DQ8NGD1AH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n タオル、ペンライト、団扇、ボード全部全部見つけるぞーという気持ちでしたよ👀。\n \n \n \n \n 写真たちを載せます☺︎\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1VRQ6Y10VTCZMMXV8YN12","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1VT28SSHBKQSWD6V1FP5S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1VVKE1KHX8TFP3JBPZMTZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1VWNNF3NTA0VVE4JMNDYX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1VXRZ55VPSG3AN850FF5E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1VZG9FE5Y3W0QH45NP15A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1W15KV5FHWPWQ7W3TZT2W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1W2F80SXJK2JR90JKRF38","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 着替えがいのうえとお隣でした。\n 写真撮ってる私が鏡にうつってる！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1W3Z649WYSCQJHZ2JVZCF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1W5SZ0WFV0EDX7CWXZ65G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1W6XC19T69K69MVTN7ZYJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n いっぱいありがとう。\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1W802G8RH50M8HCB3951Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 22歳最後のブログかなー。\n ねこちゃんの歳ありがとうございました🐱\n 色んなことがあったけど最後に皆さんのお顔を見ることができて嬉しかったです☺︎\n \n 23歳も一緒に素敵な歳にしてください。\n \n \n 以上22歳の関有美子でしたー🐱\n \n \n じゃあ、今日はここまでです！\n \n \n 最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました！\n \n \n 関有美子🐱             "}],"source":"archive"}